// InstallService: the platform-component install surface of ADR-0021, served
// (issue #60). It is `kelson install` at the API plane: the same pins table,
// the same detection-first eligibility, the same preview-confirm-apply shape —
// the confirmation step is the client's (the UI shows the plan and asks), and
// Install re-plans server-side so nothing stale is ever applied.
//
// ListComponents is the onboarding question — "what does this cluster have,
// and what is kelson offering to add?" — answered from the pins table crossed
// with live detection. Presence is the tri-state of issue #144 and travels as
// data: "yes", "no" and "unknown" are three answers, and a client must never
// collapse the third into the second.

